{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14226440","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226440","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1422643001:":{"text":"こっちじゃ。","source_cn":"诸位请跟我来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x912147A97C8FE6B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1422643002:":{"text":"私はこれ以上進めないようですね。","source_cn":"看来我无法前行了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA265E5573167576E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1422643003:":{"text":"むむ……妙じゃのう。","source_cn":"这……奇怪了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C22723685964336","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422644001:1":{"text":"呪いは解かれておるというのに、聖丘への立ち入りが許されぬとは……","source_cn":"已经解除了诅咒，却仍然不被允许踏足圣丘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CA9721C68DE45E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422644002:1":{"text":"ルナーランドを守るミルザリドと、ミサタ様の使者でもある蝶たちが行く手を阻むか。","source_cn":"守护月影乡的迈萨林德和弥萨忒的使者蝴蝶都在无声地阻拦着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4CB42F68C4FD2E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422644003:1":{"text":"ミサタは今も、追放した私たちを受け入れてはくれないのですね……","source_cn":"所以，被驱逐的我们，仍然被弥萨忒所厌弃吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE9997C5846E136F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422644004:1":{"text":"これまでの情報を踏まえるに、この拒絶には、もっと根深い理由があるはずです。まずは、それを突き止めるべきかと……","source_cn":"根据我们已知的信息来推断，这种抗拒必然有更深层的原因。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40E503EEFDB59F74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422644005:1":{"text":"それならば、鹿霊に選ばれし者に答えを見つけてもらおう。","source_cn":"既然如此，那就得让更受鹿灵眷顾的人去寻求答案了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DA36B0FF1F61122","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422644006:1":{"text":"ブライアン、エルロンを呼び戻すのじゃ。","source_cn":"布莱恩，设法叫埃隆回来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB47D6C4CCEDD7BCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422644007:1":{"text":"エルーナを探しに向かわせます。彼の正確な居場所は分かりませんが、先生が呼んでいることを伝えておきます。","source_cn":"埃隆最近在外游历，位置难以确定。我会让艾洛娜去寻找，同...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91502BDE4D7162FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1422644008:0":{"text":"あなたたちが見守るなか、ブライアンはエルーナを空へ放った。あとは知らせを待つだけだ……","source_cn":"布莱恩在你们的注视下放飞了艾洛娜，接下来就是等待了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36B12C6DE1591CDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422644009:1":{"text":"さて、エルロンが戻るまで、ブライアンには客人の案内を頼もうかのう。彼に、わしらの先祖が暮らしていた土地を紹介してやってくれ。","source_cn":"很好。在等待他归来的时间里，就请你带着我们的客人四处走...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x342834411C0A4230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422644010:1":{"text":"承知しました。では、インドラ殿、案内は私に任せてくれ。","source_cn":"我明白了，雅顿老师。我会尽我所能为诸位提供向导。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAEE147D8DAD383A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422644011:1":{"text":"感謝する、ブライアン殿。私も……こことサロクディアがどう違うのか、気になっていたんだ。","source_cn":"感谢你，布莱恩先生。我也……很好奇，这里和萨洛克兰的区别。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53954C9AFD3CFEBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1422644011":{"text":"感謝する、ブライアン殿。私も……こことサロクディアがどう違うのか、気になっていたんだ。","source_cn":"感谢你，布莱恩先生。我也……很好奇，这里和萨洛克兰的区别。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53954C9AFD3CFEBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422644012:1